  <text>
    <body>
      <p>William C. Nash is listed as the proprietor of the <ref target="civic?id=Bush%20Inn%20hotel">Bush Inn</ref> at 170 Victoria Street in the 1920 directory.</p>
      <p>He is on the 1919 electoral roll as William Charles H. Nash, Bush Inn Hotel, 170 Victoria Street, a hotelkeeper.</p>
      <p>See also <ref target="civic?id=Bush%20Inn%20hotel">Bush Inn</ref> and <ref target="civic?id=Hotels">Hotels</ref>.</p>
      <p><hi rend="italic">Only records that are clearly the same person, at the hotel's address and in a hotel trade, are linked to this entry.</hi></p>
    </body>
